    `list_filters_by_owner_for_non_admin_but_not_for_admin`, `list_pagination_returns_requested_page`,
    `list_filter_combines_with_owner_restriction`, `list_ingredients_forbidden_without_group_membership`,
    `update_forbidden_for_non_owner_allowed_for_owner`, `update_ignores_client_supplied_owner`,
    `update_with_invalid_owner_id_in_body_does_not_fail`,
    `get_and_delete_nonexistent_recipe_return_404` et `entity_without_hook_override_is_unaffected`
    exercent ./core.rs et ../rbac.sdd vus depuis la surface assemblée (specs enfants à produire) ;
    `before_create_hook_mutation_is_applied_at_insert` et
    `before_create_hook_error_blocks_insert_without_mrd_code` couvrent le scenario « position
